      "id": 4519065813103,
      "title": "Orange Pecan Granola",
      "handle": "alpen-fuel-orange-pecan-granola",
      "body_html": "<p>When you are craving a simple meal loaded with flavor, reach for Orange Pecan Granola.\u00a0 Every small batch is infused with fresh orange zest and is loaded with hearty pecans to keep you energized for miles of adventure.\u00a0 A crowd favorite, this meal is sure to find a permanent place in your backpack.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>PREP</strong><span>\u00a0</span>- quick 5 minute prep with hot or cold water (contains powdered milk)<br>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>NUTRITION</strong><span>\u00a0</span>- gluten free, vegetarian, and low sodium</li>\n<li>\n<strong>INGREDIENTS</strong><span>\u00a0</span>- all natural, clean ingredients</li>\n<li>\n<strong>FUEL</strong><span>\u00a0</span>- endurance tailored nutrition\u00a0keeps you fueled\u00a0for 3-4 hours\u00a0with steady energy, no bloating or sugar crashes!</li>\n<li>\n<strong>CALORIES</strong><span>\u00a0</span>- 630</li>\n<li>\n<strong>PROTEIN -\u00a0</strong>18g</li>\n<li>\n<strong>WEIGHT</strong><span>\u00a0</span>- 4.4oz</li>\n<li>\n<strong>SHELF LIFE</strong><span>\u00a0</span>- 18 months</li>\n<li>\n<strong>SMALL BATCH</strong><span>\u00a0</span>- made\u00a0in small batches by a Montana owned small business</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">How to make:</strong></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Mix with 4-5oz of hot or cold water<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Stir thoroughly<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Wait 5 minutes and enjoy!</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong>Ingredients:</strong> Granola (Organic Gluten Free Rolled Oats, Pecans, Organic Maple Syrup, Organic Coconut Oil, Brown Rice Crisps, Sugar, Salt, Orange Zest, Orange Extract, Cinnamon), Nonfat Powdered Milk<br><strong>Contains:</strong> Coconuts, Milk, Pecans</p>",
