      "title": "Monster Trail Cookies",
      "handle": "monster-trail-cookies",
      "body_html": "<p><span></span><span>Angry Pika Trail Cookies are the only cookie custom made for life on the trail.\u00a0 </span>They are super durable, contain lots of fat and protein for sustained energy, and taste amazing!\u00a0 Unlike candy bars and granola bars,\u00a0our Trail Cookies can be easily eaten in both hot and below freezing temperatures.</p>\n<p>Monster Trail Cookies - A crowd favorite classic made with peanuts, mini M&amp;Ms, and chocolate chips. Each 4.3oz pouch contains 8 cookies.<br></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span><strong>TASTE</strong><span>\u00a0</span>-\u00a0Our variety of flavors is a welcome relief\u00a0from the same old tired granola bars you have been eating for years.\u00a0 Plus, they are cookies.\u00a0 Everyone loves cookies.</span></li>\n<li>\n<strong>NUTRITION</strong><span>\u00a0</span>- Gluten free, vegetarian, and low sodium (only 5% DV sodium per serving).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>VERSATILITY</strong> - Is it a snack, dessert, or meal replacement?\u00a0 Perfect for your backpack, road trip, gym bag, or ski jacket pocket.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>DURABILITY\u00a0</strong>-\u00a0The opposite of a Hidden Valley granola bar, these babies are up for adventure.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>CALORIES</strong><span>\u00a0</span>- 660\u00a0calories per pouch!</li>\n<li>\n<strong>FUEL</strong><span>\u00a0</span>- Endurance tailored nutrition\u00a0keeps you fueled with steady energy, no bloating or sugar crashes!</li>\n<li>\n<strong>RESEALABLE POUCH\u00a0</strong>-\u00a0Keeps your backpack or jacket pocket free of crumbs.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>SHELF LIFE</strong><span>\u00a0</span>- 12 months</li>\n<li>\n<strong>SMALL BATCH</strong><span>\u00a0</span>- Made\u00a0in small batches by a Montana owned small business.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Ingredients</strong>:\u00a0 Organic Gluten Free Rolled Oats, Organic Maple Syrup, Gluten Free Flour (Rice Flour, Brown Rice Flour, Whole Sorghum Flour, Tapioca Starch, Potato Starch, Cellulose, Vitamin and Mineral Blend), Organic Coconut Oil, Peanut Butter (Roasted Peanuts, Sugar, Hydrogenated Vegetable Oil), Peanuts, Semi-Sweet Chocolate (Sugar, Chocolate Liquor, Milkfat, Cocoa Butter, Soy Lecithin), M&amp;Ms (Milk Chocolate (Sugar, Chocolate, Skim Milk, Cocoa Butter, Milkfat, Lactose, Soy Lecithin, Salt, Artificial Flavors), Sugar, Cornstarch, Corn Syrup, Dextrin, FD&amp;C Blue 2 Lake, Blue 1 Lake, Yellow 5, Yellow 6, Yellow 6 Lake, Red 40, Red 40 Lake, Blue 1, Yellow 5 Lake, Blue 2), Carnauba Wax, Gum Acacia), Brown Rice Crisps, Vanilla, Xanthan Gum, Flax, Baking Powder, Cinnamon, Salt<br>Contains: Coconuts, Milk, Peanuts, Soy</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>",
