    {
      "id": 4509381984367,
      "title": "Granola Variety Pack",
      "handle": "granola-variety-pack",
      "body_html": "<p><span></span><span>Angry Pika granola meals are the most convenient high calorie breakfast meals on the market!\u00a0 They have been field tested by endurance athletes, ultralight backpackers, and hunters from New Mexico to Alaska.\u00a0 No matter what your backcountry adventure throws at you, attack it head on by fueling your body with clean, balanced energy - Angry Pika Granola.</span><br></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span><strong>TASTE</strong> - amazing variety of flavors\u00a0you can enjoy day after day on the trail</span></li>\n<li>\n<strong>PREP</strong> - quick 5 minute prep with hot or cold water\u00a0- all meals contain powdered milk</li>\n<li>\n<strong>NUTRITION</strong> - gluten free, vegetarian, and low sodium (only 12% DV sodium on average)</li>\n<li>\n<strong>INGREDIENTS</strong> - all natural, clean ingredients</li>\n<li>\n<strong>CALORIES</strong> - 630-770 calories, the highest calorie granola breakfast meals on the market!</li>\n<li>\n<strong>FUEL</strong> - endurance tailored nutrition\u00a0keeps you fueled\u00a0for 3-4 hours\u00a0with steady energy, no bloating or sugar crashes!</li>\n<li>\n<strong>BULK</strong> - low bulk, 30% less packaging and bulk than\u00a0other meals</li>\n<li>\n<strong>SHELF LIFE</strong><span>\u00a0</span>- 18 months</li>\n<li>\n<strong>SMALL BATCH</strong> - made\u00a0in small batches by a Montana owned small business</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>The Variety Pack contains:</strong></p>\n<p>1x\u00a0<a title=\"Angry Pika Caramel Apple Granola\" href=\"https://angrypikafood.com/collections/backpacking-meals/products/caramel-apple-granola\">Caramel Apple</a><br>1x\u00a0<a title=\"Angry Pika Lemon Berry Granola\" href=\"https://angrypikafood.com/collections/backpacking-meals/products/lemon-berry-granola-1\">Lemon Berry Granola</a><br>1x <a href=\"https://angrypikafood.com/products/chocolate-strawberry-granola\" title=\"Angry Pika Chocolate Strawberry Granola\">Chocolate Strawberry Granola</a><br>1x\u00a0<a href=\"https://angrypikafood.com/collections/backpacking-meals/products/cranberry-white-chocolate-granola-nut-free\" title=\"Angry Pika Cranberry White Chocolate Granola\">Cranberry White Chocolate (nut-free)</a></p>\n<p><strong>How to make:</strong><br></p>\n<p>Mix with 4-5oz of hot or cold water<br>Stir thoroughly<br>Wait 5 minutes and enjoy!</p>",
